riables $(x,y)\\to (r,\\theta ),\\text{d}A=r\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta ,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{∬}_{D}4-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}A & =4{∬}_{D}(4-{r}^{2})\\,r\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{3}4r-{r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\,\\text{d}\\theta {\\int }_{0}^{3}4r-{r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r \\\\  & =4\\cdot 2\\pi \\cdot {[2{r}^{2}-\\frac{1}{4}{r}^{4}]}_{0}^{3} \\\\  & =8\\pi \\cdot (18-\\frac{81}{4}) \\\\  & =-18\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Let ${S}_{2}$ denote the bottom surface. On this surface, we have $z=0$ for ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}\\le 9.$ Therefore, for everywhere on ${S}_{2},$ we have\n\n$$\nF(x,y,0)=⟨0,\\,0,\\,0(4-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2})⟩=⟨0,\\,0,\\,0⟩.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{{S}_{2}}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{{S}_{2}}0\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S \\\\  & ={∬}_{{S}_{2}}0\\,\\text{d}S \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{S}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S \\\\  & ={∬}_{{S}_{1}}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S+{∬}_{{S}_{2}}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S \\\\  & =-18\\pi +0 \\\\  & =-18\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535588 true] [17592186356409 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356410 13194139535588 true] [17592186356409 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356411 13194139535588 true] [17592186356409 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356412 13194139535588 true] [17592186356409 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356413 13194139535588 true] [17592186356409 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356414 13194139535588 true] [17592186356409 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535588 true] [17592186356409 1041 "selection" 13194139535588 true] [17592186356409 1104 #edb/ref 17592186356414 13194139535588 true] [17592186356409 1110 #uuid "00155215-0cf8-5178-a478-adc4ce9a60df" 13194139535588 true] [17592186356410 1034 "12\\pi " 13194139535588 true] [17592186356410 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535588 true] [17592186356410 1111 #uuid "e308bfe2-5810-5917-b05f-46e3b09fae20" 13194139535588 tr