-y,\\,y+x,\\,z⟩\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}⟨x,y,z⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}⟨x-y,\\,y+x,\\,z⟩\\cdot ⟨x,y,z⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}(x(x-y)+y(y+x)+{z}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}({x}^{2}-xy+{y}^{2}+xy+{z}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot 9 \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can calculate the flux of $F$ across $S$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{S}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S \\\\  & ={∬}_{S}3\\,\\text{d}S \\\\  & =3{∬}_{S}\\,\\text{d}S \\\\  & =3\\cdot \\text{Area}(S) \\\\  & =3\\cdot 4\\pi \\cdot {3}^{2} \\\\  & =108\\pi \\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535588 true] [17592186356444 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356445 13194139535588 true] [17592186356444 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356446 13194139535588 true] [17592186356444 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356447 13194139535588 true] [17592186356444 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356448 13194139535588 true] [17592186356444 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356449 13194139535588 true] [17592186356444 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535588 true] [17592186356444 1041 "selection" 13194139535588 true] [17592186356444 1104 #edb/ref 17592186356448 13194139535588 true] [17592186356444 1110 #uuid "b207f87f-d52f-55c0-8a2c-c25837dedc4d" 13194139535588 true] [17592186356445 1034 "92\\pi " 13194139535588 true] [17592186356445 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535588 true] [17592186356445 1111 #uuid "85c12b33-811e-508e-8645-0004d80a7b1c" 13194139535588 true] [17592186356446 1034 "12\\pi \\sqrt{3}" 13194139535588 true] [17592186356446 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535588 true] [17592186356446 1111 #uuid "2e1dec43-3890-5284-aa58-a559c521ca8e" 13194139535588 true] [17592186356447 1034 "36\\pi \\sqrt{3}" 13194139535588 true] [17592186356447 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535588 true] [17592186356447 1111 #uuid "6474ca8e-aaf3-530b-a667-30bbfa2bbfd7" 13194139535588 true] [17592186356448 1034 "108\\pi " 13194139535588 true] [17592186356448 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535588 true] [1